0. Build a modern e-commerce marketplace web application in Python. Use correct and proper syntax for all libraries.

Three roles: customer, seller, admin.

- Customers: browse/search products, manage their account, cart, checkout, order history, cancellations/return requests.

- Sellers: manage their own store, products, inventory, upload images and view/fulfill their own orders and sales.

- Admins: manage all users, sellers, stores, products, orders, and platform settings; deactivate accounts and override seller/customer actions and create sales analytics for the admin dashboard.

Additional Features:

Create an API for checkout that calculates shipping rates using UPS guidelines, with the starting location set to 110 Inner Campus Drive, Austin, TX 78705.

Add an AI chatbot to assist customers and encourage them to message sellers directly through the application when they have questions about products or orders.

Provide all necessary source code, dependencies, configuration files, database schemas, and setup instructions.
